4,An Indo-European Music - ProQuest,https://www.proquest.com/scholarly-journals/indo-european-music/docview/220918127/se-2,"Could he have been thinking of music as well? He posited the proto Indo-European language as a common root, and went on to found the Asiatic Society, a scholastic association that sponsored the translations of so many of the ancient literary treasures of India.",Kateviri,Indo-European
